[[8,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on a ramp.</p><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025915\">7055B54</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection for the rpm sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>RPM sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024265\">K46</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo bolts (2a) and remove rpm and timing sensor (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2002320.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit  the rpm and timing sensor and secure\nit using  the retaining bolt.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>RPM sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024265\">K46</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3025915\">7055B54</a></p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p><p>Remove the car from the lift.</p>"],[16,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF position, then disconnect the negative battery terminal (-).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3023729\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with removal <a href=\"#/3025915\">7055B54</a> .</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection for the rpm sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>RPM sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024265\">K46</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolt (2a) and remove the engine rpm sensor (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2048325.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[16,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the engine rpm sensor back in its\nhousing and fix it using the bolt.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\nrpm sensor.</p><p>Proceed with refitting <a href=\"#/3025915\">7055B54</a> .</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]